    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/1f6e39bd7f14528ff329f6f48324256c.webp?t=1748787238\" width=600 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/a67ae5e5d4f8d8b331b409b26e3bb60f.poster.avif?t=1748787238\" width=600 height=197 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/a67ae5e5d4f8d8b331b409b26e3bb60f.webm?t=1748787238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Cosmic Cosmonaut, you take the helm as a fearless Soviet space explorer.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/b1f5729f648b3482e490bcc6e2c33bdc.poster.avif?t=1748787238\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/b1f5729f648b3482e490bcc6e2c33bdc.webm?t=1748787238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a vast frontier</strong>, filled with awe-inspiring nebulae, vibrant planets, and curious moons. Each celestial body holds its own secrets and challenges. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/20bbd34c8b6bb4c7ae73772a6342ec52.poster.avif?t=1748787238\" width=600 height=255 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/20bbd34c8b6bb4c7ae73772a6342ec52.webm?t=1748787238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intriguing Alien Encounters</strong>: Meet a menagerie of alien species, each with their own unique cultures, technologies, and needs. Befriend them, trade with them, or overcome them in strategic challenges. All characters fully voiced! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/a53d53dc7c695ee2968ecbeae3d657da.poster.avif?t=1748787238\" width=600 height=203 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/a53d53dc7c695ee2968ecbeae3d657da.webm?t=1748787238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galactic Commerce</strong>: Utilize your trusty spaceship as a vessel for intergalactic trade. Buy low, sell high, and amass resources to upgrade your ship and fulfill lucrative contracts for the Soviet Union. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/6e6266c342f1a31b49f242f0207b4094.poster.avif?t=1748787238\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/6e6266c342f1a31b49f242f0207b4094.webm?t=1748787238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve the Motherland</strong>: Earn prestige and advancements by fulfilling missions for the Soviet space program. Discover valuable resources, forge alliances with friendly alien civilizations, and secure the Union's place in the cosmos!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/d5701d06efd634d76ef4439a83b3691a.poster.avif?t=1748787238\" width=600 height=181 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/d5701d06efd634d76ef4439a83b3691a.webm?t=1748787238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/ddf49b2ec56bee9692399f360cd77c89.webp?t=1748787238\" width=600 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong>: Seek out new worlds and uncover the mysteries of the galaxy.<br><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diplomacy and Trade</strong>: Build relationships with alien species and manage your balance sheet.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/9e8f47a9fc34a09802c5ef241afa8b8f.poster.avif?t=1748787238\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/9e8f47a9fc34a09802c5ef241afa8b8f.webm?t=1748787238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/9e8f47a9fc34a09802c5ef241afa8b8f.mp4?t=1748787238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Depth</strong>: Navigate diverse challenges and make critical decisions that impact your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A touch of Cold War flair</strong>: Represent the Soviet Union with pride as you and your fleet explore and exploit the vastness of space.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/23eeb0980169d28624d4785d1edd3fa0.webp?t=1748787238\" width=600 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic Cosmonaut awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/96d93fc811e3db396878020b396247d4.poster.avif?t=1748787238\" width=250 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/96d93fc811e3db396878020b396247d4.webm?t=1748787238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
