s for the Soviet space program. Discover valuable resources, forge alliances with friendly alien civilizations, and secure the Union's place in the cosmos!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/d5701d06efd634d76ef4439a83b3691a.poster.avif?t=1748787238\" width=600 height=181 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/d5701d06efd634d76ef4439a83b3691a.webm?t=1748787238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/ddf49b2ec56bee9692399f360cd77c89.webp?t=1748787238\" width=600 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong>: Seek out new worlds and uncover the mysteries of the galaxy.<br><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diplomacy and Trade</strong>: Build relationships with alien species and manage your balance sheet.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/9e8f47a9fc34a09802c5ef241afa8b8f.poster.avif?t=1748787238\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/9e8f47a9fc34a09802c5ef241afa8b8f.webm?t=1748787238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/9e8f47a9fc34a09802c5ef241afa8b8f.mp4?t=1748787238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p cla